  "description": "Version-35 recurrent PPO followed by clean NMCC policy improvement. PPO learns from complete realized episode returns. At every visited decision state, NMCC simulates WAIT and every feasible equal-capacity shelter from one common-noise snapshot, forms a complete capacity-aware exposure-removal value table, and fits the actor to its KL-constrained improvement target. There is no heuristic continuation policy, correction gate, learned candidate fill, fallback controller, or privileged candidate-ranking observation. Panic and casualties remain reported outcomes but are absent from reward.",
